    "lyrics": [],
    "notes": "One part (Violin), one staff, 32 bars of 4/4.  Key signature changes at bars 5 (C# major, 7 sharps), 9 (Db major: 7 naturals + 5 flats), 13 (Cb major, 7 flats), 17 (B major: 7 naturals + 5 sharps), 21 (F# major, no double bar), 25 (Gb major: 6 naturals + 6 flats, mid-system, no double bar) and 29 (A minor: 6 naturals).  Bars 9-28 are pairs of enharmonically equivalent keys, so the same staff positions must be read with different signatures.  A correct conversion has every <key> change at the right bar (fifths 7,-5,-7,5,6,-6,0) and spells B#4 (bar 6/7), F##5, Bbb4, Fb5, E#5, B#5 exactly; note B#4/B#5 belong to octave 4/5 (they sound C5/C6) and Cb5 to octave 5.  The cancellation naturals before each new signature are not notes.  The key change at bar 5 sits at a line break: LilyPond prints a courtesy key signature at the end of system 1."
  },
